{{ItemBox|name=Kahi Ceremony Gift|picture=xmas_present.png|extra=A traditional box from a Tarrery ceremony that took place every year in the darkest parts of Kif. The contents are part of a sacred ritual that supposedly warded off The Kahi.}}
The '''Kahi Ceremony Gift''' was an item that was found across Foundation during the Christmas/New Year's season in 2018.

===Items===
When opened the box gave 1 of the 4 following items. These items were added to the player's [[Stash]] and steam inventory. They are Tradable but not Marketable on the the Steam Market.
